{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-roguelite you <strong>play as the spirit of a fisherman</strong> named Theo, who died at sea and desires to go back to his old life on the other side of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you are <strong>stuck in the Drift</strong>, the land between the living and the dead, you will encounter other restless spirits who've been dwelling and manifesting into abominations, <strong>preventing you from reaching your home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your harpoon, you must <strong>fight your way from island to island</strong> with your fishing boat to <strong>collect resources</strong>, so you can <strong>craft upgrades according to your play style</strong> and be able to defeat the restless abominations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669510?t=1751495173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669510?t=1751495173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669510/210c9d186ce3570eefb00e8bccd4f5544bb48b6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751495173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669510/210c9d186ce3570eefb00e8bccd4f5544bb48b6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751495173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-roguelite you <strong>play as the spirit of a fisherman</strong> named Theo, who died at sea and desires to go back to his old life on the other side of the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since you are <strong>stuck in the Drift</strong>, the land between the living and the dead, you will encounter other restless spirits who've been dwelling and manifesting into abominations, <strong>preventing you from reaching your home</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your harpoon, you must <strong>fight your way from island to island</strong> with your fishing boat to <strong>collect resources</strong>, so you can <strong>craft upgrades according to your play style</strong> and be able to defeat the restless abominations.</p>","developers":["Lumino Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669510/5bb753a39dde14c9f1209405edb4dfdd441bb31c/header.jpg?t=1751495173","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3669510/1090170380/ad5b73913ae75ee8ff7fe6498ce08af5bacd9308/1751490781/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751495171","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3669510/1090170380/ad5b73913ae75ee8ff7fe6498ce08af5bacd9308/1751490781/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751495171","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3669510/1090170380/ad5b73913ae75ee8ff7fe6498ce08af5bacd9308/1751490781/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751495171","id":257155944,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155944/movie480.mp4?t=1751495171","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155944/movie_max.mp4?t=1751495171"},"name":"A Wake Between Worlds | Early Development","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155944/e28f5ae708f9770d3959ece4776cfc40bbfec985/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751495171","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155944/movie480_vp9.w